Attributions
============

ledkit-rp contains no third-party code. Its PIO program has the same four
instructions as the Raspberry Pi `ws2812.pio` example (pico-examples,
BSD-3-Clause), written out with the `pio` crate's assembler; the delays are
computed by ledkit-core's equal-period search instead of being fixed. The pulse
timings come from ledkit-core; see its NOTICE.
